              "text": "(d) RENEWAL OF MAINTENANCE TERM. The maintenance term shall renew automatically for successive terms of twelve (12) months each, unless Sparkling gives Garman written notice of non-renewal not less than thirty (30) calendar days before the end of the then-current maintenance term. Garman shall give Sparkling written notice of the upcoming renewal, including any proposed change in maintenance fees, not less than sixty (60) calendar days before the end of the then-current maintenance term. Maintenance fees for any renewal term shall not exceed the fees payable for the then-current term increased by the lesser of (i) the percentage increase in the Consumer Price Index over the preceding twelve (12) months and (ii) three percent (3%)."
